  "details": "I think there should be an avatar script for teleporting, and walking/ crawling on walls/ceilings we have seen avatars fly, and go invisible, but what about teleporting. lets say for example if i was an enderman, and wanted to actually have the ability to teleport instead of going invisible for a period of time before reappearing again. Also, lets say I was spiderman, or a character that can walk on walls, there should be a script for that as well. I dont want to go to a specific world for that, I want to actually do it.",
